{"id":"n75897-1-9","stage":5,"title":"정적 · 寂静","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n75897-1-9-1","ko":"성적표를 받은 아이들의 반응이 어땠어요?","zh":"孩子们收到成绩单后反应怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"성적표를","meaning":"成绩单","explanation":"성적표：成绩单；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"성적표","audio":"/audio/8e382091f4d26867f306.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64458","senseId":"1","lemma":"성적표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받은","meaning":"取得，获得","explanation":"받다：取得，获得；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"4","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이들의","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반응이","meaning":"反应","explanation":"반응：反应；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"반응","audio":"/audio/791889c5b68580a48bb2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15850","senseId":"1","lemma":"반응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어땠어요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8e382091f4d26867","term":"성적표","zh":"成绩单","audio":"/audio/8e382091f4d26867f306.mp3","entryId":"64458","definition":"把学生学习的东西以考试等形式来评价后，记录结果的表。","pronunciation":["성적표"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"取得，获得","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"得到分数或学位等。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"791889c5b68580a4","term":"반응","zh":"反应","audio":"/audio/791889c5b68580a48bb2.mp3","entryId":"15850","definition":"对某种刺激表现出一定的动作或态度；或指那种动作或态度。","pronunciation":["바ː능"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/ae7d54338484940275a5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n75897-1-9-2","ko":"일순간 교실에 정적이 돌던데요.","zh":"那一瞬间教室里一片寂静。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일순간","meaning":"一瞬间","explanation":"일순간：一瞬间","readings":[{"term":"일순간","audio":"/audio/05475e87cfb0ca21cead.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72822","senseId":"1","lemma":"일순간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교실에","meaning":"教室","explanation":"교실：教室；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"교실","audio":"/audio/ed3c8c7f5e586d363644.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64472","senseId":"1","lemma":"교실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정적이","meaning":"寂静","explanation":"정적：寂静；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"정적","audio":"/audio/f430d3f5b1918f1dd69d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75897","senseId":"1","lemma":"정적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돌던데요.","meaning":"现出，浮现，显出","explanation":"돌다：现出，浮现，显出；던데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"돌다","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75006","senseId":"8","lemma":"돌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"05475e87cfb0ca21","term":"일순간","zh":"一瞬间","audio":"/audio/05475e87cfb0ca21cead.mp3","entryId":"72822","definition":"非常短的瞬间。","pronunciation":["일쑨간"]},{"id":"ed3c8c7f5e586d36","term":"교실","zh":"教室","audio":"/audio/ed3c8c7f5e586d363644.mp3","entryId":"64472","definition":"在幼儿园、小学、初中和高中等地教师教授学生的房间。","pronunciation":["교ː실"]},{"id":"f430d3f5b1918f1d","term":"정적","zh":"寂静","audio":"/audio/f430d3f5b1918f1dd69d.mp3","entryId":"75897","definition":"安静到有些凄凉的程度。","pronunciation":["정적"]},{"id":"2dc53ba2c5ff682d","term":"돌다","zh":"现出，浮现，显出","audio":"/audio/2dc53ba2c5ff682d012f.mp3","entryId":"75006","definition":"某种气势或光亮显露出来。","pronunciation":["돌ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5d3c2b7972d8075c8d82.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.384,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=75897","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":162,"sequenceScore":3.2107,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["孩子们收到成绩单后反应怎么样？","那一瞬间教室里一片寂静。","本来就是每天喝的普通咖啡，今天却莫名地觉得好喝啊。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["孩子们收到成绩单后反应怎么样？","那一瞬间教室里一片寂静。","本来就是每天喝的普通咖啡，今天却莫名地觉得好喝啊。"],"answer":1}]}
